 ### `CODEOWNERS`

 I'd put this at:

```
.github/CODEOWNERS
```

 The exact team names in GitHub need to match your **organization's team slugs**. If your teams are literally named `devops`, `backend`, `frontend`, `cybersecurity`, and `data-analytics`, you can use:

